      <h2 id="what-title">What it is for</h2>
      <p>Finding accounting help usually means choosing between firms, directories and online filing services without a clear view of who does the work or what they are qualified to do.</p>
      <p class="para">AccountOrbit is meant to help with that first step: working out what kind of professional your work calls for, and enquiring about an introduction where one is possible. The work itself stays with the professional you choose.</p>
      <p class="para">It also publishes plain explanations, so that you can make a better decision with or without us.</p>
    </div>
